  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p><br /></p><p><span>Hi all，<br />【时光邮局】活动将于3月23日00:00:00-3月26日23:59:59上线，现申请相关上线配置。<br /><br /><br />辛苦@叶导 审批，<br />辛苦@灿灿&nbsp;配置。<br /><br /><br />具体需求如下（资源图钉钉提供）：<br /><strong>一、活动中心</strong><br />标题：春日繁花盛宴<br />时间：3月23日00:00:00-3月27日23:59:59<br />色值：</span>linear-gradient(90deg, #5b240a 0%, #471b06 100%)</p><p><span><br /></span><span>位置：第一位，<strong><br /></strong><br /><strong>二、icon</strong><br />标题：春日繁花盛宴<br />文案：<span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">解锁得</span><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">专属奖励</span><br />时间：3月23日00:00:00-3月26日23:59:59<br />类型：所有直播间<br />位置：第一位</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><strong>三、首页banner</strong><br />时间：3月23日00:00:00-3月26日23:59:59<br />位置：第一位<br /><br /><strong>四、全站私信</strong><br />3月23日00:00:00<br />文案：【春日繁花盛宴】<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">赠送活动专属礼物，帮助主播完成</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">任务升级场景，解锁丰富奖励～</span></span></p><p><span><strong>五 、开屏</strong><br />时间：3月23日00:00:00-3月24日23:59:59</span></p><p><span>位置：第一位<br /></span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><strong>六、直播间icon</strong><br />时间：3月23日00:00:00-3月26日23:59:59</span></p><p><span>位置：第一位</span></p><p><span><br /><strong>七 、礼物墙</strong><br />标题：春日繁花<br />时间：3月23日00:00:00-3月26日23:59:59<br />所有专属礼物均配置礼物墙banner</span></p><table style=\"text-decoration: none;\"><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td style=\"text-align: center;\">名称</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">价值</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">礼物ID</td><td><br /></td><td>备注</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td style=\"text-align: center;\">飞信传情</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">24268</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MzkwNzEyNzYzOSMgNTUjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MzkwNzEyNzYzOSMgNTUjcG5n.png</a></td><td>【飞信传情】用户送给主播，主播获得1热力值，剩余参与飞信传情，最高可获得<span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">520</span>热力值礼物。</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td style=\"text-align: center;\">长相思</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">77</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">24275</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcyMjg0MDA0MTE1NiM4OTgjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcyMjg0MDA0MTE1NiM4OTgjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td style=\"text-align: center;\">邮来心动</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">24269</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MzkwNzE1NDQ4MiMgNjAjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MzkwNzE1NDQ4MiMgNjAjcG5n.png</a></td><td>【邮来心动】用户送给主播，主播获得5热力值，剩余参与邮来心动，最高可获得<span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">13140</span>热力值礼物。</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td style=\"text-align: center;\">梦游仙镜</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">520</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">24276</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MzA2MjgzMTIwMCMgNDgjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MzA2MjgzMTIwMCMgNDgjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td style=\"text-align: center;\">灵蛇仙姬</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1314</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">24277</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MTIyODE2Mjc0MSM0MjQjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MTIyODE2Mjc0MSM0MjQjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td style=\"text-align: center;\">潘多拉仙境</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">24278</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0Nzk5NTUxMzM3MCMxMzQjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0Nzk5NTUxMzM3MCMxMzQjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td style=\"text-align: center;\">耶耶日记</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">13140</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">24279</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc1Mzc3MTAyNDc5NyMgMzUjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc1Mzc3MTAyNDc5NyMgMzUjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td style=\"text-align: center;\">爪爪联萌</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">33440</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">24280</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc1Mzc3MTE2MzQxNCMzNzYjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc1Mzc3MTE2MzQxNCMzNzYjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td style=\"text-align: center;\">沧澜绮梦</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">99999</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">24281</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NTkwOTg3MTk0MSM1MDYjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NTkwOTg3MTk0MSM1MDYjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p><span><strong><br />八、</strong><strong>称号链接更换</strong><br /><br />&nbsp;添加称号链接，修改上线时间及白名单配置修改为否</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><br />链接见下方<br /><br /><strong>链接如下：<br /></strong>数据链接：<a href=\"https://actapi.busi.inke.cn/api/act/act202603/post_office/icon\" class=\"\">https://actapi.busi.inke.cn/api/act/act202603/post_office/icon</a><br /><br /></span></p><p class=\"p1\">Banner: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=banner\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=banner</a></p><p class=\"p1\">直播间icon: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=icon\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=icon</a></p><p class=\"p1\">金刚区: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=kong\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=kong</a></p><p class=\"p1\">活动中心: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=task\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=task</a></p><p class=\"p1\">私信: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=msg\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=msg</a></p><p class=\"p1\">闪屏: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=screen\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=screen</a></p><p class=\"p1\">Push: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=push\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=push</a></p><p class=\"p1\">首页弹窗: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=hallhot\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=hallhot</a></p><p class=\"p1\">站外: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=other\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=other</a></p><p class=\"p1\">房间消息: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=room_msg\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=room_msg</a></p><p class=\"p1\">我的页选项: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=me\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=me</a></p><p class=\"p1\">直播间插件入口: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=pluginik_halfdisplay=1&amp;half_screen=1\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=pluginik_halfdisplay=1&amp;half_screen=1</a></p><p class=\"p1\">礼物墙banner: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=giftwall\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=giftwall</a></p><p class=\"p1\">广播页面: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=broadcast\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=broadcast</a></p><p class=\"p1\">二维码: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=qrcode\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=qrcode</a></p><p class=\"p1\">称号: <a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=name\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/banner/202603/time-post-office/index.html?from=name</a></p><p class=\"p1\"><br /></p><p class=\"p1\"><br /></p><p class=\"p1\"><br /></p><p class=\"p1\">以上，如有问题及时沟通～</p><p class=\"p1\"><br /></p><p class=\"p1\"><br /></p><p class=\"p1\"><br /></p><p class=\"p1\"><br /></p><p class=\"p1\"><br /></p><p><br /></p>",
